### ShopSense - slice 1 smoke test
### Run the app first (dotnet run), then send these.
### VS Code REST Client / Rider can run these directly, or use the curl below.

@base = http://localhost:5080

### Ingest a fridge temperature reading
POST {{base}}/readings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sensorId": "fridge-1",
  "metric": "temperature_c",
  "value": 4.5
}

### Ingest a door reading (1 = open)
POST {{base}}/readings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sensorId": "front-door",
  "metric": "door_open",
  "value": 1
}

### List all readings (newest first)
GET {{base}}/readings
